// CPlayerGuiDef::Transfer(CPersistContext& context) -- persist the player GUI definition: one CPersistContext transfer per member
//   +0x3C..+0xAB0 (scalars, colours, vectors, strings, the button sub-def vectors and the three named maps with a zero default)
// Leaf: ?Transfer@CPlayerGuiDef@@UAEXAAVCPersistContext@@@Z
// Retail: Fable.exe (TLC, VC7.1) function @ 0x004736C4, 6498 bytes (virtual slot 18 of vtable 0x012352DC, thiscall, `ret 4`).
// Identity (proven): vtable 0x012352DC slot 18 (slot 18 = Transfer for every def class); Ego_r.pdb and FableWin.pdb
//   ?Transfer@CPlayerGuiDef@@UAEXAAVCPersistContext@@@Z.
// Callees (all out of line): CPersistContext::Transfer<long> 0x00431102, <float> 0x00431061, <CRGBColour> 0x004595A3,
//   <C2DVector> 0x004568BC, <C3DVector> 0x00456903, <CCharString> 0x00431143, <unsigned long> 0x00431020; TransferVector<long>
//   0x00466A47, <float> 0x00464CBF, <CRGBColour> 0x00468EB4, <C2DVector> 0x00475D99, <CCharString> 0x004331F9;
//   TransferVectorOfSubComponents<CAbilityButtonGuiDef> 0x0047652B, <CQuickAccessItemButtonGuiDef> 0x00476024;
//   TransferMap<long,CCharString> 0x00475026 ("ScriptSprites", "MiniMapGraphics"), <EGameAction,CCharString> 0x0047550F
//   ("GameActionValues").
// TU: `optimize("y", off)` + `("s", on)` (def TU, as CSoundThemeDef::Transfer 0x0046329E): the map defaults live in the dead
//   `context` slot (`and dword ptr [ebp+8],0`).
// Shape: retail order is declaration order except the minimap colours (+0x994 before +0x98C / +0x990; theme colours before zone).
// Headers: engine/CPlayerGuiDef.h opt-in FABLE_RETAIL_CPLAYERGUIDEF_CLASS, FABLE_RETAIL_DEF_CLASS_BASE, FABLE_RETAIL_CPERSISTCONTEXT
//   + _NAMED_DEFAULTS (the 3-argument TransferMap).
